                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="Legend&lt;br&gt;• Blue = Customer Tenant resources • Green = Provider Tenant resources • Orange = Anthropic-operated / third party • Red = hard constraint • Amber = alternative path or note to reconfirm&lt;br&gt;• Solid green arrow = Private Link (no peering, NAT applied, approval workflow) • Dashed amber arrow = alternative public-endpoint path" vertex="1">
